===Argentina vs Nigeria===
On six minutes, an unmarked [[Gabriel Heinze]] dived forward to head home [[Juan Sebastián Verón]]'s corner kick and put Argentina 1–0 up.<ref>{{cite news |url=https://news.bbc.co.uk/sport2/hi/football/world_cup_2010/matches/match_04/default.stm |title=Argentina 1-0 Nigeria |first=Phil |last=Dawkes |publisher=BBC |access-date=28 August 2019 }}</ref> [[Lionel Messi]] had numerous chances for Argentina following that, but on each occasion, Nigerian goalkeeper [[Vincent Enyeama]] was able to keep the margin down to one.<ref name="theguardian.com">{{Cite web|url=https://www.theguardian.com/football/2010/jun/12/argentina-nigeria-world-cup-group-b|title=Argentina 1-0 Nigeria &#124; World Cup 2010 Group B|date=12 June 2010}}</ref> Enyeama's saves earned him the man of the match award. Post-match, Argentina coach [[Diego Maradona]] said he was confident his side would perform well in the future.<ref name="theguardian.com"/>

